{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0532_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "effcb6a37a5bca2d9d723da3a55bbb07a19375d47f46ff3509c5c8332c9382a1", "ja": "そこで、花火なんてどうですか？　手持ちのやつ、\n買うてくるんです。絶対盛り上がると思うんです！", "zh": "所以，放烟花怎么样？买些手持烟花回来。我觉得肯定会很热闹的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
