{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0532_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "b0d6077406ffd5b4e1ff7bbc4b961e3da361c8e45f5c5e627b830f2ee94dfb15", "ja": "ですよね！　せっかくですし、\nこっそり準備してみんなをビックリさせません？", "zh": "对吧！难得有这个机会，要不要悄悄准备一下，给大家一个惊喜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0532_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1199338cc7066e767eeb46a2411c5db413ece47772fb38528b86ce0f874a8601", "ja": "はは、いいな。\nそれじゃ、ふたりでサプライズを仕掛けようか。", "zh": "哈哈，不错。\n那我们俩一起准备个惊喜吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
